WEBVTT

00:07:27.045 --> 00:07:30.926
If you have democracy,
people will vote for washing machines.

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:32.435
They love them!

00:07:32.459 --> 00:07:33.725
(Laughter)

00:07:34.236 --> 00:07:36.020
And what's the magic with them?

00:07:36.044 --> 00:07:39.276
My mother explained
the magic with this machine

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:41.777
the very, very first day.

00:07:41.801 --> 00:07:43.311
She said, "Now, Hans.

00:07:44.275 --> 00:07:45.760
We have loaded the laundry.

00:07:45.784 --> 00:07:47.501
The machine will make the work.

00:07:47.525 --> 00:07:49.666
And now we can go to the library."

00:07:50.159 --> 00:07:53.100
Because this is the magic:
you load the laundry,

00:07:53.124 --> 00:07:55.406
and what do you get out of the machine?

00:07:55.430 --> 00:07:58.731
You get books out of the machines,

00:07:58.755 --> 00:07:59.907
children's books.

00:07:59.931 --> 00:08:02.276
And mother got time to read for me.